WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.480
Part 2. You will hear a recruitment officer called Megan Baker giving a talk at a jobs

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:12.360
fair about opportunities for those interested in the food and agriculture sectors.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:16.879
First, you have some time to look at questions 11 to 14.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Now, listen carefully and answer questions 11 to 14.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:51.759
Hello everyone. My name's Megan Baker and I'm a recruitment consultant at AVT Recruitment

00:00:51.759 --> 00:00:59.040
Specialists. Now, our company specialises in positions that involve working in the agriculture

00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:05.199
and horticulture sectors, so that's fresh food production, garden and park maintenance

00:01:05.199 --> 00:01:13.080
and so on. And these sectors do provide some very special career opportunities. For a start,

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:18.400
they often offer opportunities for those who don't want to be stuck with a 40-hour week

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:24.919
but need to juggle work with other responsibilities, such as childcare, and this is very important

00:01:24.919 --> 00:01:31.639
for many of our recruits. Some people like working in a rural setting, surrounded by

00:01:31.639 --> 00:01:38.800
plants and trees instead of buildings, although we can't guarantee that. But there are certainly

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:43.720
health benefits, especially in jobs where you're not sitting all day looking at a screen

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:50.639
– a big plus for many people. Salaries can sometimes be good too, although there's a

00:01:50.639 --> 00:01:56.800
lot of variety here. And you may have the opportunity in some types of jobs for travel

00:01:56.800 --> 00:02:02.879
overseas, although that obviously depends on the job, and not everyone is keen to do

00:02:02.879 --> 00:02:10.679
it. Of course, working outdoors does have its challenges. It's fine in summer, but can

00:02:10.679 --> 00:02:16.880
be extremely unpleasant when it's cold and windy. You may need to be pretty fit for some

00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:23.919
jobs, though with modern technology that's not as important as it once was. And standards

00:02:23.919 --> 00:02:29.559
of health and safety are much higher now than they used to be, so there are fewer work-related

00:02:29.559 --> 00:02:37.279
accidents. But if you like a lively city environment surrounded by lots of people, these jobs are

00:02:37.279 --> 00:02:43.839
probably not for you – they're often in pretty remote areas. And some people worry

00:02:43.839 --> 00:02:50.880
about finding a suitable place to live, but in our experience this usually turns out fine.

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:42.880
Now, let me tell you about some of the exciting jobs that we have on our books right now.

00:03:42.919 --> 00:03:49.919
One is for a fresh food commercial manager. Our client here is a very large fresh food

00:03:49.919 --> 00:03:56.919
producer, supplying a range of top supermarkets. They operate in a very fast-paced environment

00:03:56.919 --> 00:04:03.919
with low profit margins. The staff there work hard, but they play hard as well, so if you've

00:04:03.919 --> 00:04:10.919
a sociable personality, this may be for you. We have an exciting post as an agronomist,

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:17.959
advising farmers on issues such as crop nutrition, protection against pests, and the latest

00:04:17.959 --> 00:04:23.959
legislation on farming and agricultural practices. There are good opportunities for the right

00:04:23.959 --> 00:04:29.959
person to quickly make their way up the career ladder, but a deep knowledge of the agricultural

00:04:29.959 --> 00:04:37.959
sector is expected of applicants. A leading supermarket is looking for a fresh produce

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:44.000
buyer who is available for a 12-month maternity cover contract. You need to have experience

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:51.000
in administration, planning and buying in the fresh produce industry, and in return

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:58.000
will receive a very competitive salary. We have also received a request for a sales

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:04.000
manager for a chain of garden centres. You will be visiting centres in the region to

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:10.040
ensure their high levels of customer service are maintained. This post is only suitable

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:17.040
for someone who is prepared to live in the region. There is also a vacancy for a tree

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:24.040
technician to carry out tree cutting, forestry and conservation work. Candidates must have

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:31.040
a clean driving licence and have training in safety procedures. A year's experience

00:05:31.079 --> 00:05:36.079
would be preferred, but the company might be prepared to consider someone who has just

00:05:36.079 --> 00:05:43.079
completed an appropriate training course. Finally, we have a position for a farm worker.

00:05:43.079 --> 00:05:50.079
This will involve a wide range of farm duties, including crop sowing and harvesting, machine

00:05:50.079 --> 00:05:57.079
maintenance and animal care. Perks of the job include the possibility of renting a small

00:05:57.119 --> 00:06:04.119
cottage on the estate and the chance to earn a competitive salary. A driving licence and

00:06:04.119 --> 00:06:09.119
tractor driving experience are essential.

00:06:27.079 --> 00:06:32.119
For more information visit www.fema.gov

